id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.5.4-Universal
versionCode=554
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=Bit-to-bit audio for QF001/K706: 24-bit/48 kHz path at 0 dB, volume and effects on BU32107 only. One playback output per PCM, raw microphone for wDSP/Vosk, navigation ducking, call microphone with headroom and echo cancellation on SIM (handsfree CVS) and BT calls without forced communication mode.
